  "content": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 在這個生存世界中，你將探索高聳的山峰、深邃的山谷與綿延的河流。顯然比一般原版Minecraft生存更加出色。你可以將此世界用於伺服器。</p><p>&nbsp; <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082089/description_4dfdda8a-0672-4efd-87fd-16df6c1625cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"405\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 這張地圖提供了原版所欠缺的特色：</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 平滑的地形</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 農田</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 自訂森林</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 山岳景觀梯度</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 還有更多<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">更多</span>！！！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 這些專案得以實現，全靠像您這樣慷慨的捐贈。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 玩得開心 :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">也來看看我的其他地圖！</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七個生存島嶼</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘之島</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">J.M.J.</span></strong></p>",
